      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-24T22:56:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Correct.&nbsp; It's still an environment card, but it's not anything else.&nbsp; You'd need another room in play before you could get another Entry Point to stick.&nbsp; It is still an environment card, though, so you could still use a Grappling Hook on it or something, but that wouldn't really accomplish anything.</p>",
