      "id": 96589,
      "name": "Dandolo",
      "username": "Dandolo",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-10-19T12:33:57.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My guess is the card will be errata’d to play then shuffle in the video game.  Actually,  I think I’m going to house rule it to that in the meantime.</p>\n<p>As to the question of whether cards under entry point are still rooms… I’d say no. Cards under cards like Savage Mana or Omnicannon have no keywords or game text. That makes the “A card under this card has no game text” on entry point completely redundant but doesn’t make those cards have keywords.</p>\n<p>Note: this is all just me speculating, I have no specific knowledge as to how this works.</p>",
