      "created_at": "2016-10-19T15:25:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If cards under cards lose their keyword status then Entry Point shuffles itself back into the deck as soon as it covers a card (providing there are no other Room cards in play).</p><p>I'm not arguing that your interpretation is wrong, just that the cards are badly worded.</p>",
